{"title":"HR Executive Roadmap","role":"HR Executive","summary":"An HR Executive supports the employee lifecycle across recruitment, onboarding, HR operations, employee records, attendance, payroll coordination, engagement, learning and development, performance processes and HR reporting.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"B.Com – Marketing / Retail / HR"},"about":[{"label":"Typical degree duration","text":"3 or 4 years depending on university structure"},{"label":"Career alignment","text":"Strong"},{"label":"Primary route","text":"B.Com → HR Internship → HR Executive/HR Operations Trainee → HR Executive → Senior HR Executive → HR Generalist/HR Specialist → HR Manager"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"HR intern, recruitment intern, HR operations intern, HR Executive Trainee"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"HR Operations, Talent Acquisition, Payroll, L&D, HR Analytics or Employee Relations"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior HR Executive, HR Business Partner, HR Specialist or HR Manager"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"HR Manager, HRBP Lead, Talent/People Analytics Lead, Head of HR or People Operations leader"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a B.Com – Marketing / Retail / HR graduate, this is a strong and practical entry-level career path. Students should combine HR fundamentals with business knowledge, communication, Excel, HR technology, labour-law awareness and people analytics."},{"type":"h","text":"Strong future profile:"},{"type":"flow","items":["HR","Business","Excel/Analytics","HR Technology","Communication","AI"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Strong/direct alignment."},{"type":"p","text":"The degree can provide business, management and HR fundamentals. To become employable, students should additionally build practical capability in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"HR operations"},{"text":"Employee lifecycle management"},{"text":"Payroll fundamentals"},{"text":"Labour-law awareness"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Training & development"},{"text":"HR analytics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"HRMS/HRIS"},{"text":"Business communication"},{"text":"Conflict handling"}]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are career-planning horizons, not guaranteed promotion timelines."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Business, management and communication fundamentals"},{"text":"University + NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"HR terminology and case notes"},{"text":"Business foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"HR fundamentals + Excel"},{"text":"NPTEL + Microsoft Excel","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"},{"text":"Employee database workbook"},{"text":"HR operations"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Recruitment + interviewing"},{"text":"HR case studies + industry resources"},{"text":"Recruitment process project"},{"text":"Talent acquisition"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Payroll + HR operations + labour-law basics"},{"text":"NPTEL + official government resources"},{"text":"HR operations simulation"},{"text":"Operational readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Internship + HRMS exposure"},{"text":"Industry"},{"text":"Internship + HR dashboard"},{"text":"Employability"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"HR analytics + specialisation"},{"text":"Power BI + SQL + HR analytics resources"},{"text":"People analytics project"},{"text":"Differentiation"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Strategic HR + AI"},{"text":"NPTEL + industry learning"},{"text":"HR strategy/AI project"},{"text":"Future readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2 (if applicable)"},{"text":"Recruitment preparation"},{"text":"Employers + mock interviews"},{"text":"Job offer / placement"},{"text":"Career entry"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core HR skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Human Resource Management"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HR planning"},{"text":"Recruitment"},{"text":"Selection"},{"text":"Onboarding"},{"text":"Employee lifecycle"},{"text":"Performance management"},{"text":"Compensation"},{"text":"Benefits"},{"text":"Employee engagement"},{"text":"Learning & development"},{"text":"Career development"},{"text":"Employee relations"},{"text":"HR policies"},{"text":"Separation/offboarding"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the complete employee lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Workforce planning","Recruitment","Selection","Offer","Onboarding","Development","Performance","Engagement","Retention","Exit"]}]},{"heading":"Recruitment & Talent Acquisition","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build practical skills in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Job description creation"},{"text":"Candidate sourcing"},{"text":"Resume screening"},{"text":"Boolean search"},{"text":"Applicant tracking systems"},{"text":"Interview scheduling"},{"text":"Candidate communication"},{"text":"Interview coordination"},{"text":"Interview evaluation"},{"text":"Offer coordination"},{"text":"Candidate pipeline management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn recruitment metrics:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Time to hire"},{"text":"Time to fill"},{"text":"Cost per hire"},{"text":"Offer acceptance rate"},{"text":"Source effectiveness"},{"text":"Interview-to-offer ratio"},{"text":"Offer-to-join ratio"},{"text":"Early attrition"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio project"},{"type":"h","text":"Recruitment Funnel Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Applications","Screening","Interviews","Offers","Joining"]}]},{"heading":"HR Operations","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Employee master data"},{"text":"Joining documentation"},{"text":"Employee files"},{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Leave management"},{"text":"Payroll inputs"},{"text":"Employee letters"},{"text":"HR policies"},{"text":"Transfers"},{"text":"Promotions"},{"text":"Exit documentation"},{"text":"Full & final settlement concepts"},{"text":"HR compliance documentation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should understand the difference between:"},{"type":"flow","items":["HR Operations","Payroll","Recruitment","Employee Relations","HR Analytics"]}]},{"heading":"Payroll fundamentals","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An HR Executive does not necessarily need to become a payroll specialist, but should understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gross salary"},{"text":"Net salary"},{"text":"CTC"},{"text":"Basic salary"},{"text":"Allowances"},{"text":"Deductions"},{"text":"Bonuses"},{"text":"Incentives"},{"text":"Leave"},{"text":"Attendance"},{"text":"Statutory deductions"},{"text":"Payroll processing workflow"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn the current applicable rules for areas such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"EPF"},{"text":"ESI"},{"text":"Professional Tax where applicable"},{"text":"Income-tax/TDS"},{"text":"Gratuity"},{"text":"Leave-related requirements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Labour and tax regulations change, so current rules should always be verified through official sources before implementation."}]},{"heading":"Labour-law awareness","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Build foundational knowledge of India's employment framework."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts related to:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Wages"},{"text":"Working hours"},{"text":"Leave"},{"text":"Social security"},{"text":"Employee benefits"},{"text":"Workplace safety"},{"text":"Grievance mechanisms"},{"text":"Employment contracts"},{"text":"POSH compliance"},{"text":"Industrial relations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For legal compliance, do not rely solely on course notes or AI-generated summaries. Verify the current rules with official government/legal sources."}]},{"heading":"HR Analytics","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the strongest differentiators for a modern HR Executive."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Data cleaning"},{"text":"KPI design"},{"text":"Dashboard development"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Headcount"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Absenteeism"},{"text":"Hiring"},{"text":"Employee tenure"},{"text":"Compensation"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Training"},{"text":"Engagement"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Example:"},{"type":"flow","items":["HR data","SQL/Excel","Analysis","Power BI","Management decision"]}]},{"heading":"HR technology","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Become familiar with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HRMS"},{"text":"HRIS"},{"text":"ATS"},{"text":"Payroll systems"},{"text":"Employee self-service platforms"},{"text":"Performance management systems"},{"text":"Learning management systems"},{"text":"CRM-style recruitment tools"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand the purpose of platforms rather than memorising one vendor."}]},{"heading":"AI in HR","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Learn how AI is being used for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Resume screening"},{"text":"Candidate sourcing"},{"text":"Interview scheduling"},{"text":"Employee support"},{"text":"HR chatbots"},{"text":"Workforce analytics"},{"text":"Attrition prediction"},{"text":"Learning recommendations"},{"text":"Job-description generation"},{"text":"Employee sentiment analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn the risks:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bias"},{"text":"Discrimination"},{"text":"Privacy"},{"text":"Explainability"},{"text":"Data security"},{"text":"Incorrect automated decisions"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A future HR professional should know when AI should assist humans and when human judgement must remain central."},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Build at least 6 projects."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Recruitment Funnel Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Applications"},{"text":"Shortlisted candidates"},{"text":"Interviews"},{"text":"Offers"},{"text":"Joining"},{"text":"Rejection reasons"},{"text":"Hiring source"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel or Power BI."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Employee Attrition Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Using synthetic/anonymised data, analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Department"},{"text":"Age band"},{"text":"Tenure"},{"text":"Salary band"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Manager/team"},{"text":"Job satisfaction"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not use real employee personal data without appropriate authorization."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — HR Workforce Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Total employees"},{"text":"New hires"},{"text":"Exits"},{"text":"Attrition"},{"text":"Gender distribution"},{"text":"Department"},{"text":"Location"},{"text":"Tenure"},{"text":"Employee movement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Training & Development Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Training hours"},{"text":"Training cost"},{"text":"Employees trained"},{"text":"Completion rate"},{"text":"Assessment scores"},{"text":"Skill gaps"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Compensation Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a synthetic compensation dataset and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Salary bands"},{"text":"Department"},{"text":"Experience"},{"text":"Role"},{"text":"Internal salary distribution"},{"text":"Compensation trends"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Avoid making employment decisions from simplistic correlations."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 6 — HR Policy / Employee Lifecycle Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete fictional HR process:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Recruitment","Offer","Onboarding","Probation","Performance","Promotion","Exit"]},{"type":"p","text":"Document the policies and workflows professionally."},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn","Senior role"],"rows":[[{"text":"HR Operations"},{"text":"HR + HRMS + Excel"},{"text":"Employee lifecycle"},{"text":"HR Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"Talent Acquisition"},{"text":"Recruitment + ATS"},{"text":"Sourcing, interviewing"},{"text":"Talent Acquisition Manager"}],[{"text":"HR Analytics"},{"text":"HR + SQL + Power BI"},{"text":"People analytics"},{"text":"People Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"Payroll"},{"text":"HR + payroll systems"},{"text":"Compensation and compliance"},{"text":"Payroll Manager"}],[{"text":"Learning & Development"},{"text":"HR + training"},{"text":"L&D strategy"},{"text":"L&D Manager"}],[{"text":"Employee Relations"},{"text":"HR + labour relations"},{"text":"Grievance/conflict"},{"text":"ER Manager"}],[{"text":"Compensation & Benefits"},{"text":"HR + finance"},{"text":"C&B design"},{"text":"C&B Manager"}],[{"text":"Performance Management"},{"text":"HR + analytics"},{"text":"KPIs, performance systems"},{"text":"Performance Lead"}],[{"text":"HR Business Partner"},{"text":"HR + business"},{"text":"Strategy + people"},{"text":"HRBP"}],[{"text":"People Operations"},{"text":"HR + technology"},{"text":"Employee experience"},{"text":"People Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"HR Technology"},{"text":"HR + technology"},{"text":"HRIS/automation"},{"text":"HR Technology Lead"}],[{"text":"Organisational Development"},{"text":"HR + psychology"},{"text":"Culture/change"},{"text":"OD Manager"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant — 2035–2046"